SAFETY WARNING - ETB 271 experiments - SoftDevice and bootloader package to bootloader V1.01.0000
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
THIS TEST REFLASHES SENSOR 5C1712 THROUGH THE J-LINK WITH V10.00.0000,
UPGRADES IT OVER THE AIR (SOFTDEVICE, BOOTLOADER AND APPLICATION), AND
SWITCHES THE GPD-3303D'S OUTPUT ON, WITH CHANNEL 2 AT 3.3 V. A failed
over-the-air step can leave the unit in its bootloader; teardown restores it
through the J-Link (ETB v0.02.0000 proved send_package and probe.restore
on 5C1712, #244 and #264). Channel 2 must power sensor
5C1712 and nothing else; channel 1 is held at 0 V.
